From 362526e544b38e8d3ff8e78b756a6d66f151cde0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lij768423-svg <lij768423@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 19:56:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix: dual-probe recovery and require thinking on QUALITY_OK

Isolate immediately on user-traffic degrade and hold through
quarantine_seconds. Restore only after a QUALITY_OK probe comes back
healthy with thinking tokens. Missing thinking is a hard isolate even
when TPS looks normal.
